flowchart TB
    APP([宿主应用])
    NODE["交互节点（ProtocolNode / DdsNode / TcpServer）"]
    CODEC["Codec 公共扩展点"]
    TCP([TCP 对端])
    UDP([UDP 对端])
    SER([串口设备])
    DDS([DDS Domain / Topic])

    APP -->|RT_IF_API：节点/配置/订阅/请求/可观测| NODE
    NODE -->|RT_IF_SYSFRAME / DDS 消息格式| CODEC
    NODE -->|RT_IF_TCP| TCP
    NODE -->|RT_IF_UDP| UDP
    NODE -->|RT_IF_SERIAL| SER
    NODE -->|RT_IF_DDS| DDS

    classDef app fill:#eef2f7,stroke:#93a4b5,color:#233;
    classDef node fill:#eef5fb,stroke:#3d6a8c,color:#233;
    classDef codec fill:#fbf6ef,stroke:#b8860b,color:#233;
    classDef ext fill:#f2f7fb,stroke:#7d8b99,color:#233;
    class APP app;
    class NODE node;
    class CODEC codec;
    class TCP,UDP,SER,DDS ext;
